# Apple code signing
# The provisioning profile is per-developer: it is bound to one team, one set of
# certificates and a specific list of provisioned devices, so a committed copy is
# unusable by anyone else and embeds device UDIDs. Create your own — see
# docs/macos-development.md.
embedded.provisionprofile
*.mobileprovision
